  "notes": "Thompson writes 'the great white rhinoceros (Ceratorhinus)'. The white rhinoceros is Ceratotherium simum; 'Ceratorhinus' Gray 1867 is actually a synonym of Dicerorhinus (Sumatran rhinoceros), so the parenthetical generic name is Thompson's error. Resolved by the vernacular."
